          "source_chunk_id": "paper-0776f0af6f06613433bef8112cc493177534bcf42a91636c9739e789f76ec110-p0001-c00004",
          "source_text": "本文记录一次本机矩阵运算计时实验，用于验证科研文稿的中译英、术语一致性与数字回溯。矩阵维度为64、128、256、512、1024，每项操作重复7次，取耗时中位数，单位为毫秒。",
          "translated_text": "This paper records a local matrix operation timing experiment, used to verify Chinese-to-English translation of research manuscripts, terminology consistency, and numerical traceability. The matrix dimensions are 64, 128, 256, 512, and 1024; each operation is repeated 7 times, and the median elapsed time is taken, in milliseconds.",
          "paper_id": "paper-0776f0af6f06613433bef8112cc493177534bcf42a91636c9739e789f76ec110",
          "page_number": 1,
          "section_path": [
            "摘要"
          ],
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
