          "source_text": "实验配置请求1个计算线程，实际线程数未独立测量，随机种子为20261029。本文同时使用编码器、解码器、注意力机制与低秩适配等术语作为翻译检查内容，不宣称运行了这些模型。",
          "translated_text": "The experimental configuration requests 1 compute thread; the actual thread count was not independently measured, and the random seed is 20261029. This paper also uses terms such as encoder, decoder, attention mechanism, and low-rank adaptation as translation check content, and does not claim that these models were run.",
          "paper_id": "paper-0776f0af6f06613433bef8112cc493177534bcf42a91636c9739e789f76ec110",
