          "source_text": "科学翻译需要保留原文位置、术语和数字。注意力机制可以连接编码器与解码器；低秩适配和人类反馈是本次写作测试使用的领域词汇，本计时实验不评价其性能。",
          "translated_text": "Scientific translation needs to preserve the original positions, terminology, and numbers. The attention mechanism can connect the encoder and decoder; low-rank adaptation and human feedback are domain terms used in this writing test, and this timing experiment does not evaluate their performance.",
          "paper_id": "paper-0776f0af6f06613433bef8112cc493177534bcf42a91636c9739e789f76ec110",
